			"notes": "## Changelog\n* Fixed crash when no resources were within the mods folder\n* Fixed audio engine bugs/crashing due to race conditions on startup\n* Fixed occasional crash when hot reloading resources\n* Modified condition checks for swinging a weapon to no longer spam audio when mining blocks\n* User now gets a verbose warning and instructions on how to install resources if none are present\n* Shimmed logging to use Log4j\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> Be sure to download the relevant ``resources.zip`` archive. The folder within the archive must be extracted to the root of your ``mods/`` directory. The structure should look like ``mods/matmos/`` in order for BTWatmos to load it's resources.\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> If you've previously installed BTWatmos, you do not need to replace your resource files."
